+## Reservations at tool readers
+
+### My reservation says Abandoned
+
+The booking was released after no qualifying check-in within fifteen minutes of its start, once all participating readers synchronized. It appears in **History** immediately. Fees and invoices are unchanged. Contact the shop's Resource Manager if you believe attendance is missing.
+
+### My booking was cancelled when I logged off
+
+Voluntary owner logoff releases the remaining whole booking, including other tools in the same booking. A kick or reader reboot does not count as voluntary release.
+
+### A no-show booking has not been released
+
+An offline participating reader can delay verification while attendance is uncertain. Ask the shop's Resource Manager about ordinary cancellation. See [Reservations at Tool Readers](/digital-makerspace/reservations/tool-readers).
+
